{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Song of Kings</i> is a puzzle platformer inspired by Sri Lankan mythology. You play as Yakshira, a young demon child taken from his homeland and trapped in a kingdom ruled by a ruthless king. Guided by the soul of his grandfather and armed with a magical flute, he must outwit enemies, solve ancient puzzles, and uncover the truth about his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through mystical forests, ruined temples, dungeons, and human settlements\u2014each filled with secrets, dangers, and forgotten stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY THE FLUTE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flute is more than an instrument\u2014it is the key to your journey. Hidden melodies lie in the world around you, and each one reveals paths, awakens secrets, and uncovers fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/c98be5b58856c088ecb4e55402b0f522.poster.avif?t=1768276636\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/c98be5b58856c088ecb4e55402b0f522.webm?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/c98be5b58856c088ecb4e55402b0f522.mp4?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTSMART YOUR ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert. Guards, creatures, and shadowy forces will stand in your way, each reacting to your presence and the sounds you create. Observe your surroundings, use the environment to your advantage, and find a way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/60034c0739602dd62ca322527ba40257.poster.avif?t=1768276636\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/60034c0739602dd62ca322527ba40257.webm?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/60034c0739602dd62ca322527ba40257.mp4?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A MYTHICAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From vibrant Yaksha villages to towering castles and ancient jungle temples, explore a world steeped in folklore and mystery. Keep your journal close\u2014it records the discoveries, places, and stories you uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/a709587a05f66e181677fe2532ae2cde.poster.avif?t=1768276636\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/a709587a05f66e181677fe2532ae2cde.webm?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/a709587a05f66e181677fe2532ae2cde.mp4?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide Yakshira back to his homeland, or will the kingdom\u2019s darkness consume him?<br>The <i>Song of Kings</i> has begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985280?t=1768276636","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/2ee7db33c449653532a9e96d8c1197cf2ce1e260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768276636","capsule_image":"ht