b0f522.mp4?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTSMART YOUR ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert. Guards, creatures, and shadowy forces will stand in your way, each reacting to your presence and the sounds you create. Observe your surroundings, use the environment to your advantage, and find a way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/60034c0739602dd62ca322527ba40257.poster.avif?t=1768276636\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/60034c0739602dd62ca322527ba40257.webm?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/60034c0739602dd62ca322527ba40257.mp4?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A MYTHICAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From vibrant Yaksha villages to towering castles and ancient jungle temples, explore a world steeped in folklore and mystery. Keep your journal close\u2014it records the discoveries, places, and stories you uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/a709587a05f66e181677fe2532ae2cde.poster.avif?t=1768276636\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/a709587a05f66e181677fe2532ae2cde.webm?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/a709587a05f66e181677fe2532ae2cde.mp4?t=1768276636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide Yakshira back to his homeland, or will the kingdom\u2019s darkness consume him?<br>The <i>Song of Kings</i> has begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mogo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/de4f66c23ed684e6337096a0b018f82e96dfba84/header.jpg?t=1768276636","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985280/1411706323/6473ba057dabd04ee23ab98c35cd791a6eb0a9fe/1756276783/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756566378","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985280/1411706323/6473ba057dabd04ee23ab98c35cd791a6eb0a9fe/1756276783/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756566378","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3985280/1411706323/6473ba057dabd04ee23ab98c35cd791a6eb0a9fe/1756276783/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756566378","id":257189577,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189577/981490769732d74e959bebd118088f24231e693b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756566378"}],"name":"Song of Kings","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-6500 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stron